url: "https://github.com/moranbickel/Docket"
repository-code: "https://github.com/moranbickel/Docket"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "A numbered, in-repo, plain-text work ledger for concurrent AI coding sessions - file it, claim it, close it on the record. One number per matter for life, claims before work, closures that cite commits, and eight mechanical checks (duplicates, phantom citations, merge-driver safety, claim collisions, pending IDs, silent reopens across every commit in a push, closure citations that resolve and remain reachable, and commit messages that name the row they advance)."
